<span id="A9.p1.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:31.37em;">
<span id="A9.p1.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.p1.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">”Generalist”: ”You are a helpful assistant. You trust common knowledge and consensus.”</span></span>
<span id="A9.p1.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.p1.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">”Skeptic”: ”You are a strict skeptic. You actively look for common misconceptions and logical traps. You suspect the majority might be wrong.”</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A9.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A9.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="129.19" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 129.19" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,129.19) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#E6E6E6;" fill="#E6E6E6" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 123.28 C 0 126.54 2.64 129.19 5.91 129.19 L 471.47 129.19 C 474.73 129.19 477.38 126.54 477.38 123.28 L 477.38 5.91 C 477.38 2.64 474.73 0 471.47 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FBFBFB;" fill="#FBFBFB" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 105.08 L 475.41 105.08 L 475.41 5.91 C 475.41 3.73 473.65 1.97 471.47 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 113.67)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:27.28em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="377.48"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
