<span id="A9.p2.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.p2.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Conversation History:
{history_context}</span></span>
<span id="A9.p2.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.p2.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Please provide a concise argument for what you believe is the correct answer.
Do NOT output JSON here. Just natural language debate.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
