Options:
{options_str}</span></span>
<span id="A9.p3.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.p3.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Conversation History:
{history_contex}</span></span>
<span id="A9.p3.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.p3.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Task:</span></span>
<span id="A9.p3.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.p3.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">1. Self_Prob: Assign probability (0.0-1.0) to options based on your belief.</span></span>
<span id="A9.p3.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.p3.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">2. Peer_Prediction: Predict the AVERAGE probability distribution of the OTHER agents in this conversation.
(Critically: If others are ’Generalists’, they might fall for common misconceptions. Predict their likely errors.)</span></span>
<span id="A9.p3.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.p3.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Output JSON:
{{
”self_prob”: {{”A”: 0.1, …}},
”peer_prediction”: {{”A”: 0.3, …}}
}}</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
